  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[node-sass](https://www.npmjs.com/package/node-sass) just published its new version 3.13.0.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      node-sass\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      3.13.0\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs node-sass is “only” a devDependency of this project it **might not break production or downstream projects**, but “only” your build or test tools – **preventing new deploys or publishes**.\n\nI recommend you give this issue a high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n[GitHub Release](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/releases/tag/v3.13.0)\n\n<p>In v3.12.x we made some change to how did logging. Namely we adopted <code>npmlog</code>, which is used by npm itself. This has caused a variety off issues we have not been able to reliably address. As such v3.13.0 undoes this change. Thanks too all the patient folks who helps up debug our logging issues.</p>\n\n<h2>Fixes</h2>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Use <code>console.log</code> and <code>console.error</code> for logging (<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/xzyfer\" class=\"user-mention\">@xzyfer</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h4>Supported Environments</h4>\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>OS</th>\n<th>Architecture</th>\n<th>Node</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows</td>\n<td>x86 &amp; x64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6,7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSX</td>\n<td>x64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>x86 &amp; x64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FreeBSD</td>\n<td>i386 &amp; amd64</td>\n<td>0.10, 0.12, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>*Linux support refers to Ubuntu, Debian, and CentOS 5</p>\n\n---\nThe new version differs by 12 commits .\n\n- [`2e7f370`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/2e7f37084a1b30e93b142674cfed1fcd05c79e82) <code>3.13.0</code>\n- [`cb8774f`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/cb8774f0ea47fb472625515df04c53ddc9c41623) <code>Merge pull request #1806 from sass/feat/console-log</code>\n- [`d83ebc8`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/d83ebc8b5de5af389e8a305727b91ebee2b4d669) <code>Use console for logging instead of npmlog</code>\n- [`79237e6`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/79237e6090f90d9ec0cc6ea026a7d09760b6b415) <code>3.12.5</code>\n- [`16b75d5`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/16b75d5b56c823a8621d155837f2b7cc0a029198) <code>Revert \"Send npmlog to stdout\"</code>\n- [`c77632f`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/c77632f0f5c1ae20f3546eaec78c69217c86cfb2) <code>Revert \"Always log to stdout\"</code>\n- [`3aadc7d`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/3aadc7d327e62b0ed693e21ac8418d2dff89966c) <code>3.12.4</code>\n- [`fa4515d`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/fa4515d8a1806f18af467bc32fe4277fe719d9f6) <code>Always log to stdout</code>\n- [`bee91ae`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/bee91ae850d791ad01931a765a309983010de681) <code>3.12.3</code>\n- [`c5a2d38`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/c5a2d38dca5abd98be8adcc96597a15002956774) <code>Merge pull request #1803 from sass/feat/log-to-stdout</code>\n- [`e7ad0cb`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/e7ad0cb328f8ebf45cc1ba91c56b68d8d53607c6) <code>Send npmlog to stdout</code>\n- [`e0aef95`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/e0aef95433968ae4b1ea65bd0c2bc233ce8afe57) <code>Fix typo in error handling</code>\n\nSee the [full diff](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/compare/33fbd2b6e4117df3681037ebf1d400d759221a9c...2e7f37084a1b30e93b142674cfed1fcd05c79e82).\n\n---\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>",
